<title>ANTIGUA: CRICKET-WEST INDIES V SRI LANKA FIRST TEST SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES V SRI LANKA FIRST TEST SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>ST JOHN'S, Antigua 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the</p>
<p>third day of the first test between West Indies and Sri Lanka on</p>
<p>Sunday:</p>
<p>Sri Lanka first innings 223 (S.Jayasuriya 85; C.Ambrose 5-75)</p>
<p>West Indies first innings 189 (S.Campbell 50, M.Muralitharan 5-34)</p>
<p>Sri Lanka second innings (overnight 151-8)</p>
<p> S.Jayasuriya  c Hooper b Ambrose    0</p>
<p> R.Mahanama c Browne b Ambrose	14</p>
<p> R.Arnold c Browne b Ambrose	  12</p>
<p> A.De Silva c Browne b Bishop	 47</p>
<p> A.Ranatumga c Rose b Bishop	  13</p>
<p> R.Kaluwitharana c Browne b Walsh   16</p>
<p> K.Dharmasena c Walsh b Rose	  31</p>
<p> R.Pushpakumara c williams b Rose    8</p>
<p> S.De Silva not out			2</p>
<p> M.Muralitharan c Williams b Rose    0</p>
<p> H.Tillekeratne absent injured	 0</p>
<p> Extras  (lb-3 nb-6)		     9</p>
<p> Total				     152</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-0 2-17 3-41 4-85 5-91 6-113 7-140 8-151</p>
<p>9-152</p>
<p>Bowling: Ambrose 9-0-41-3 (nb2), Walsh 10-0-37-1 (nb3), Rose</p>
<p>9-1-42-3 (nb1), Bishop 17-0-29-2</p>
